      {
        "text": "Jessica Vasquez was appointed Cook County commissioner for the 8th District in May 2025. She previously served as chief of staff to Alderman Carlos Ramirez-Rosa. Her campaign says she helped secure the 100-unit affordable Lucy Gonzalez Parsons Apartments. She also worked with the Illinois Coalition for Immigrant and Refugee Rights.",
        "cites": [1, 2],
        "sentences": [
          {
            "text": "Jessica Vasquez was appointed Cook County commissioner for the 8th District in May 2025.",
